        "Enter ihram at the miqat with the niyyah of Umrah, perform the full Umrah, then shave or trim and leave ihram. Stay in Makkah until the 8th." to "Ku shiga ihrami a miqat da niyyah umra, ku cika umra, sannan a yi aski ko a datse a bar ihrami. Ku zauna a Makkah har zuwa 8.",
        "Follow the Umrah tab step by step." to "Bi shafin Umrah mataki-mataki.",
        "Keep away from sin; use these days for Tawaf, Quran and dua." to "Ka nisanci zunubi; amfani da wadannan ranaku don Tawafi, Alqur'ani da dua.",
        "Make the niyyah of both Umrah and Hajj together and recite the Talbiyah. This ihram stays on until Halq on the 10th." to "Ka sanya niyya ta Umra da Hajji gaba daya a karanta Talbiya. Wannan ihramin yana nan har zuwa Halk ranar 10 ga watan.",
        "Perform the Tawaf and Sa'i of Umrah but do not shave. Then perform Tawaf al-Qudum; you may do the Sa'i of Hajj after it." to "Kayi Tawafi da Sa'ayi na Umra amma kar a aske. Sannan a yi Tawaf al-Qudum; za ku iya yin Sa'ayin Hajji bayansa.",
