        "The arrival Tawaf, Sunnah for pilgrims from outside the miqat. You may do the Sa'i of Hajj after it." to "Isowar Tawafi, Sunnah ga mahajjata daga wajen miqat. Kuna iya yin Sa'ayi na Hajji bayan shi.",
        "If you will do Sa'i after it, men do Raml and Idtiba in this Tawaf." to "Idan za ku yi Sa’ayi bayansa, maza su yi Raml da Idtiba a cikin wannan Tawafin.",
        "Put on ihram in Makkah with the niyyah of Hajj, recite the Talbiyah and go to Mina. Pray Dhuhr to the next Fajr there." to "Ka yi ihrami a Makkah da niyar Hajji, ka karanta Talbiya, ka tafi Mina. Ku yi Sallar Zuhur zuwa Asuba ta gaba a can.",
        "Stay in your ihram and go to Mina with the Talbiyah. Pray Dhuhr to the next Fajr there." to "Ku tsaya a cikin ihraminku ku tafi Mina da Talbiya. Ku yi Sallar Zuhur zuwa Asuba ta gaba a can.",
        "Staying in Mina on the 8th and the night of the 9th is Sunnah." to "Tsayawa a Mina ranar 8 da daren 9 Sunnah ne.",
        "Recite the Talbiyah often." to "Ka yawaita karanta Talbiya.",
        "Being in Arafat for any moment from zawal on the 9th until dawn of the 10th fulfils the fard; staying until sunset is wajib." to "Kasancewar a Arafat na kowane lokaci daga zawal a ranar 9 ga alfijir na 10 ya cika farilla; zama har zuwa faduwar rana wajibi ne.",
        "Hanafi: Dhuhr and Asr are combined only behind the Imam of Hajj at Masjid Namirah. In your tent, pray each at its own time." to "Hanafi: Ana hada Zuhur da La'asar a bayan Limamin Hajji a Masallacin Namirah. A cikin alfarwarku, kowa ya yi addu'a a lokacinsa.",
        "Stay inside the boundary markers of Arafat." to "Tsaya a cikin alamomin iyakar Arafat.",
        "Spend the afternoon standing in dua, istighfar and Talbiyah, facing the Qibla." to "Ku ciyar da la'asar a tsaye a cikin addu'a, istighfar da Talbiyah, kuna fuskantar alqibla.",
        "Leaving Arafat before sunset makes a Dam due, unless you return before sunset." to "Barin Arafat kafin faduwar rana yana da nasaba da Damtse, sai dai idan ka dawo kafin faduwar rana.",
        "Leave Arafat after sunset without praying Maghrib. At Muzdalifah pray Maghrib and Isha together in Isha time and spend the night there." to "Bar Arafat bayan faduwar rana ba tare da yin sallar Magriba ba. A Muzdalifah ayi sallar magrib da isha'i tare a lokacin isha'i sannan a kwana a can.",
        "The wajib wuquf is between dawn and sunrise on the 10th: pray Fajr early and stay in dhikr." to "Wuqufi na wajibi yana tsakanin ketowar alfijir da fitowar alfijir a ranar 10: Sallar Asuba da wuri kuma a yi zikiri.",
        "Pick up chickpea-sized pebbles: 49 in all, or 70 if you will stay for the 13th." to "Dauki duwatsu masu girman kajin: 49 a duka, ko 70 idan za ku zauna na 13th.",
        "The sick, elderly and weak may leave after midnight because of the crowd, with no penalty." to "Marasa lafiya, tsofaffi da marasa ƙarfi na iya barin bayan tsakar dare saboda taron, ba tare da hukunci ba.",
        "Stone only Jamrat al-Aqabah (the big one) with seven pebbles, one at a time. Stop the Talbiyah with the first pebble." to "Jifa kawai Jamratul Aqabah (babbar) mai tsakuwa guda bakwai, daya bayan daya. Dakatar da Talbiyah da dutsen farko.",
        "Then offer the Qurbani (Dam-e-Shukr), then shave or trim. Hanafi: this order is wajib; breaking it makes a Dam due." to "Sannan a ba da Qurbani (Dam-e-Shukr), sannan a yi aske ko a datse. Hanafi: wannan umarni wajibi ne; karya shi yayi Dam.",
        "Then shave or trim. Qurbani is recommended for Ifrad; if you offer it, do so before Halq." to "Sannan aski ko a datse. Qurbani yana son Ifrad; idan kun ba da shi, sai ku yi kafin Halq.",
        "The Sunnah time for this Rami is from sunrise until zawal." to "Lokacin Sunnah na wannan Rami daga fitowar Alfijir har zuwa zawal.",
        "After Halq everything forbidden in ihram becomes lawful except marital relations, until Tawaf al-Ziyarah." to "Bayan Halk duk abin da aka haramta a cikin harama ya halasta sai dai mu’amalar aure, har zuwa Tawaful Ziyarah.",
        "The obligatory Tawaf of Hajj. Perform it after Halq, best on the 10th, and before sunset on the 12th." to "Tawafin Hajji na wajibi. Yi shi bayan Halq, mafi kyau a ranar 10, da kuma kafin faɗuwar rana a ranar 12th.",
        "Then perform the Sa'i of Hajj between Safa and Marwah." to "Sannan ayi Sa'ayi na Hajji tsakanin Safa da Marwah.",
        "Perform the Sa'i of Hajj now if you did not do it after Tawaf al-Qudum." to "Kayi Sa'ayi na Hajji yanzu idan bakayi ba bayan Tawaf al-Qudum.",
        "Delaying it past the 12th without excuse makes a Dam due. A woman in her period waits until she is pure, with no penalty." to "Jinkirta shi ya wuce na 12th ba tare da uzuri ba ya sanya Dam din. Mace a cikin jinin al'ada tana jira har sai ta yi tsarki ba tare da wani hukunci ba.",
        "After this Tawaf, marital relations also become lawful." to "Bayan wannan Tawafin, ma'aurata su zama halal.",
        "Spend the days in Mina. Each day after zawal stone all three — Ula, Wusta, then Aqabah — with seven pebbles each." to "Ku ciyar da kwanaki a Mina. Kowace rana bayan zawal duk ukun - Ula, Wusta, sannan Aqabah - tare da tsakuwa bakwai kowanne.",
        "After the Ula and the Wusta, step aside, face the Qibla and make a long dua. Do not stop for dua after the Aqabah." to "Bayan Ula da Wusta, sai ka koma gefe, ka fuskanci alqibla, ka yi doguwar addu'a. Kar a tsaya yin addu'a bayan Aqabah.",
        "You may leave Mina on the 12th before sunset. If you are still in Mina at dawn on the 13th, the Rami of the 13th becomes wajib." to "Kuna iya barin Mina a ranar 12 kafin faduwar rana. Idan har yanzu kuna Mina da wayewar gari ranar 13, Rami na 13 ya zama wajibi.",
        "The sick and the weak who cannot reach the Jamarat may appoint someone to stone for them." to "Marasa lafiya da marasa ƙarfi waɗanda ba za su iya isa Jamarat ba suna iya naɗa musu wanda zai jefe su.",
        "Reset the counter each day." to "Sake saita counter kowace rana.",
        "Tawaf al-Wida, wajib for pilgrims from outside the miqat. Make it your last act in Makkah." to "Tawaf al-Wida, wajibi ne ga mahajjata daga wajen miqat. Ka sanya aikinka na ƙarshe a Makkah.",
        "No Raml, Idtiba or Sa'i in this Tawaf." to "Babu Raml, Idtiba ko Sa'ayi acikin wannan Tawafin.",
