        "Hajj wajib: Muzdalifah, Sa'i, Rami, Qurbani for Qiran and Tamattu', Halq or Qasr, Tawaf al-Wida." to "Hajji wajib: Muzdalifah, Sa'i, Rami, Qurbani for Qiran and Tamattu', Halq or Qasr, Tawaf al-Wida.",
        "Umrah: Ihram is the condition and Tawaf is fard; Sa'i and Halq or Qasr are wajib." to "Umrah: Ihrami sharadi ne kuma Tawafi farida ne; Sa'i da Halq ko Qasr wajibi ne.",
        "Missing a wajib without a valid excuse makes a Dam due: one goat or sheep slaughtered within the Haram." to "Rasa wajibci ba tare da wani uzuri mai inganci ba yana da hakkin dam: akuya ko tunkiya da aka yanka a cikin Harami.",
        "Crossing the miqat towards Makkah without ihram makes a Dam due, unless you go back and enter ihram there." to "Ketare miqat zuwa Makka ba tare da harama ba yana da hakki, sai dai idan kun koma ku shiga ihrami a can.",
